### Variables (extensión REST Client de VS Code)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@apiKey = <DEVICE_API_KEY>

### Estado del servicio
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Registrar medición
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/measurements
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "timestamp": "2026-11-01T11:08:55-05:00",
  "distance_cm": 214.05
}

### Registrar medición en UTC
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/measurements
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "timestamp": "2026-11-01T16:09:25Z",
  "distance_cm": 4.92
}

### Sin API Key (debe responder 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/measurements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "timestamp": "2026-11-01T16:09:25Z",
  "distance_cm": 4.92
}

### Última medición
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/measurements/latest

### Historial
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/measurements?limit=50&offset=0

### Historial filtrado por fecha
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/measurements?start=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z&end=2026-11-02T00:00:00Z
